<title>UK: EIB adds 200 billion lire to five-year bond.</title>
<headline>EIB adds 200 billion lire to five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced by joint lead managers Banque Nationale de Paris, San Paolo and Sanwa has been increased to 700 billion lire from 500 billion lire.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    700 BLN LIRE  COUPON     7.55	MATURITY    05.NOV.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.95    PAY DATE    05.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.75	REOFFER    =	   SPREAD	+=</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 5-50	SALE LIMITS *</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.50	SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	*GENERAL SELLING RESTRICTIONS WITH SPECIFICATIONS</p>
<p>		 FOR ITALY ONLY</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
